      "width": 1880,
      "height": 1120,
      "label": "agentscope-core 运行时架构",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a000000000000002",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1180,
      "width": 1880,
      "height": 1120,
      "label": "推荐源码阅读路径",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "# 调用方\n\n应用 / Web / CLI / Harness\n\n`call()` 或 `streamEvents()`",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "# agent\n\n`Agent`：能力契约\n\n`AgentBase`：生命周期\n\n`RuntimeContext`：单次调用上下文",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# ReActAgent\n\n公开门面 + Builder\n\n模型、Toolkit、Middleware、StateStore 的装配与编排",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "# CallExecution\n\n一次调用的隔离执行域\n\n持有 AgentState、PermissionEngine、RuntimeContext、事件 sink 与中断控制",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "# Reasoning\n\n上下文 + system prompt + tool schemas\n\n通过 `Model.stream()` 获取增量响应",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "# model / formatter\n\n`Model` → `Flux<ChatResponse>`\n\nFormatter 适配 Provider 协议",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "# message / accumulator\n\n增量 chunk 累积为 `Msg`\n\n内容可能是 Text、Thinking、ToolUse、ToolResult 或多媒体",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# Acting\n\n读取 `ToolUseBlock`\n\n权限判定后交给 Toolkit / ToolExecutor",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# permission / HITL\n\nALLOW → 执行\nASK → 暂停等待确认\nDENY → 合成拒绝结果",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b00000000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "# tool\n\n`Toolkit` 管注册与 schema\n\n`ToolExecutor` 管校验、超时、重试、调度与结果转换",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b00000000000000b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "# state / memory\n\n按 `(userId, sessionId)` 装载\n\n保存上下文、摘要、权限、工具组、任务状态",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b00000000000000c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "# event\n\n执行过程的实时投影\n\nAgent / Model / Block / Tool / HITL 事件\n\n用于 UI、SSE、日志",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b00000000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "# middleware\n\n横切 5 个点：\nAgent / Reasoning / Acting / ModelCall / SystemPrompt\n\n前四个为洋葱模型",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "b00000000000000e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 930,
      "width": 1740,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "**主线：** 调用 → 生命周期 → per-call 执行域 → Reasoning → Model → Msg；若 Msg 含 ToolUseBlock，则 Acting → 权限 → 工具 → ToolResultBlock 写回上下文 → 再次 Reasoning。Middleware 与事件流贯穿全程。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c000000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1270,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "# 0. 先跑通\n\nQuickstart + `SimpleIntegrationTest`\n\n先建立输入/输出直觉",
      "color": "5"
    },
