    {
      "id": "c00000000000000e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 1810,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "# 8. 按需深入\n\nSkill / RAG / MCP / Subagent / Shutdown / Tracing / Transport\n\n先掌握主循环，再选择与你的目标有关的分支。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c00000000000000f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 1780,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "阅读原则：不要从 `ReActAgent.java` 第 1 行顺读。先学 Msg / Model / Agent / Toolkit，再跳到 `CallExecution.doCallInner`、`reasoning`、`acting`、`isFinished` 四个核心锚点。每读一个概念，配一个代表测试。"
    }
  ],
